{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服ファッションショーの続き☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7850463/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤×ホワイト。\nハートのサングラスがポイント！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7850463/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着いた色味だけど、\nフリルやリボンがついててお気に入り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7850463/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートに\nお花が散りばめられてて可愛いんだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7850463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手首にリボンを巻いたよ～。\nヘアアレンジでも使えるから、\nよく手芸屋さんにいって買うよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7850463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで\n私服ファッションショーでしたっ\\(◡̈)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteenのモデルさんになって、\nもっとたくさんのお洋服をきたい、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センスを磨いて\n自分の世界観をだしてきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"締め切りまで約1週間、\nもうちょっとで終わりだけどまだ間に合う｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のブログ読んで応援したいって人が\n1人でも増えたらいいな(＞＜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルになりたいって気持ち...\n熱意が皆さんに伝わっていたら嬉しいです｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この１ヶ月間で\n更に想いは強くなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで諦めず、\n自分や皆んなを信じて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援よろしくお願いします(＞＜)"}],"source":"archive"}